l":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":346,"closed_issues":2304,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:34:58Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-10-24T21:27:53Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T20:20:26Z","closed_at":"2026-06-18T20:20:26Z","assignee":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducable in v4.5.stable.official [876b29033], v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]\n\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7216) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-13600K (20 threads) - 31.77 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe bug is that in a specific constellation a function that returns a boolean is a GDScriptFunctionState instead of a boolean.\n```gdscript\nvar abstract: BaseClass = InheritedClass.new()\n\nvar res_v := await abstract.get_bool()\nprint(res_v == true)\nprint(res_v == true)\nprint(res_v == true)\nprint(res_v == true)\n```\nThese prints in my example give the following output:\n\n    <GDScriptFunctionState#-9223372000599210596>\n    false\n    <GDScriptFunctionState#-9223372000599210596>\n    false\n`print(res_v)` for example always returns the correct value, `print(not res_v)` returns the GDScriptFunctionState.\nThe problem occurs when these things come together:\n1. a base class with a function that is not async.\n2. an inherited class with the inherited function that is async and awaits a signal\n3. some way to emit the signal (for example awaiting for a timer timeout didn't reproduce the bug)\n\nIt works only after casting to a bool like this:\n`var result: bool = bool(res_v)`\nAlso the inheritance is important for the function. When one of these steps is done the problem disappears:\n- `var abstract: BaseClass = InheritedClass.new()` changed to `var abstract: InheritedClass= InheritedClass.new()`\n- add an `await` to the BaseClass to make the base function async (this is not possible if the function is abstract which was the case when the problem originally occured)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nI added a GitHub link to a minimal project to reproduce the bug.\nIt contains two buttons. One to start a function to await a signal and the other one to emit the signal. When the first one is pressed and then the second one, you should see the output from above in the logs with the GDScriptFunctionState.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nhttps://github.com/mLampir/Godot-Bug","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112017/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112017/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}